Fylume Source-Available Terms 1.0: Yaob learned weights

Copyright 2026 Fylume

Weights:       The learned parameters trained by Fylume for Yaob N10K, as
               published by Fylume (the "Covered Weights"):
                 - the learned router (about 3.1 million parameters): routing
                   key residuals, gate biases, the encoder and query
                   projections, MPN prototypes and scalars, stored in
                   router.safetensors, shards/shared.safetensors and
                   shards/mpn_<id>;
                 - four experimental LoRA specialist adapters (33,030,144
                   parameters each, rank 16): astronomy, chemistry, history
                   and the diagnostic canary MPN, stored in adapters/<mpn>/;
                 - the configuration and manifest files published with them.
